          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies current auditory or visual hallucinations; reports no paranoia or thought disorder and says thinking is \"pretty clear now\". Mental status examination: no delusions or ideas of reference; thought process linear and goal-directed; no current auditory or visual hallucinations."
